{"title":"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number halfway between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/3/6136193afb3f1957d9feaa1b626ccc1e01eed6f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1/8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/a/74a3d67ed68c56765f7050e4a060eb6de5470dd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1/10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" /> is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/7/3e7673dcd8ceb79ed1cc5aaa354e2cb7f88d8f47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\  } \\frac 1{80} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\  } \\frac 1{40} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } \\frac 1{18} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } \\frac 1{9} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  } \\frac 9{80}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"397\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions\">Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>To find the number halfway between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5db9e227e8177d26de452c2a2faeb6d45cc53d7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/0/4c00e9e2066800d5a55332a7fb456073bbce0a08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />, simply take the arithmetic mean, which is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/6/eb6940de3df4527d097c69e155ec4712d2c9cde5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{1}{8}+\\frac{1}{10}}{2}=\\frac{\\frac{9}{40}}{2}=\\frac{9}{80}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"149\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Thus the answer is choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/0/130156bdc5588c66a9d69e18887ac367b9c41bb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/6/d560137e37f5011218fe16ffd2ca305a0bdb6019.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{10} = 0.1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"68\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/b/8db644d89441b7d25b642028fbad65e1716ccfb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{8} = 0.125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"78\" height=\"37\" />.  Thus, the answer must be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/0/4c00e9e2066800d5a55332a7fb456073bbce0a08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />.  \n</p><p>Answers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are all less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/0/4c00e9e2066800d5a55332a7fb456073bbce0a08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />, so they can be eliminated.  \n</p><p>Answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/3/0439bd842a0bcfefef58ca8cf9485ee414a7409f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.\\overline{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/d/a6d08a654e85a29bbaf24984bd7a1a1b1a461fea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.0\\overline{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"17\" /> away from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/e/b8e15844d523efe58af54649ee285b2c23a96b20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" />, and is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/0/8d0355192111185f989120f47a6f870a2628bc96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.013\\overline{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> away from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/8/fc81dc9a203793fdb93d64488d1a0a3ce15440da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.125$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />.  These distances are not equal, eliminating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/2/55206bce678ac0394d97dc04dd72398df2bdf572.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" /> must be the answer.  Computing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/3/063df86004f0589baa820161f7cefda7240f7e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{80} = 0.1125$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"96\" height=\"37\" /> as a check, we see that it is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/7/c674affed22753b76b25a96777805ea1f35f912b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.1125 - 0.1 = 0.0125$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"169\" height=\"13\" /> away from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/0/4c00e9e2066800d5a55332a7fb456073bbce0a08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" />, and similarly it is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/e/82e73d5c8d1ffce511a4305c728d6a30ee10dfd1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.125 - 0.1125 = 0.0125$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"188\" height=\"13\" /> away from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5db9e227e8177d26de452c2a2faeb6d45cc53d7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME\" title=\"1999 AHSME\">1999 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1999 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1999\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<